   "ocr": "was more accurate in HCC prognosis than that based on other clinicopathological parameters, including single HPC marker expression. Our scoring model is simple as it is based on three easily measurable clinical factors and one HPC marker, and, therefore, may be useful in clinical practice. While we assessed HPC marker expression in resected HCC specimens by immunohistochemistry, a new method for testing HPC markers in circulating tumour cells obtained by liquid biopsy is being developed, and the relationship between EpCAM expression in liquid www.oncotarget.com"
